  "transformedHtml": "<article class=\"legal-article\" id=\"art-277\">\n  <header class=\"article-header\">\n    <h2 class=\"article-number\">Article 277</h2>\n  </header>\n  <div class=\"article-content\">\n    <div class=\"article-text\">\n      <section class=\"paragraph\">\n        <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 1er.</h3>\n        <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n          <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"1\" data-dossier-number=\"2012-12-13/48\" data-law-type=\"ARW\" data-article-number=\"1\">\n            Lorsque les éléments de la lettre de mission visés à l'article 272, § 3, \n            <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\">\n                <span class=\"provision-text\">2°</span>\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"3°\">\n                <span class=\"provision-text\">3°</span>\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"4°\">\n                <span class=\"provision-text\">4°</span>\n              </li>\n            </ol>\n            sont modifiés, le \n            <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"2\" data-dossier-number=\"2016-07-21/13\" data-law-type=\"ARW\" data-article-number=\"1\">contrat d'administration</span> \n            est revu conformément à la procédure prévue \n            <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"3\" data-dossier-number=\"2016-07-21/13\" data-law-type=\"ARW\" data-article-number=\"4\">à l'article 276/3.</span>\n          </span>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n      <section class=\"paragraph\">\n        <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 2.</h3>\n        <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n          Lorsque l'évaluation du mandataire a été réalisée conformément \n          <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"3\" data-dossier-number=\"2016-07-21/13\" data-law-type=\"ARW\" data-article-number=\"4\">à l'article 286</span>, \n          le \n          <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"2\" data-dossier-number=\"2016-07-21/13\" data-law-type=\"ARW\" data-article-number=\"1\">contrat d'administration</span> \n          peut être revu à la demande du Gouvernement, conformément à la procédure prévue \n          <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"3\" data-dossier-number=\"2016-07-21/13\" data-law-type=\"ARW\" data-article-number=\"4\">à l'article 276/3.</span>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n      <section class=\"paragraph\">\n        <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 3.</h3>\n        <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n          Le mandataire peut demander à revoir le \n          <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"2\" data-dossier-number=\"2016-07-21/13\" data-law-type=\"ARW\" data-article-number=\"1\">contrat d'administration</span> \n          lorsque les moyens budgétaires et les ressources humaines attribués ou d'autres éléments substantiels de la lettre de mission sont modifiés significativement. \n          La révision \n          <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"3\" data-dossier-number=\"2016-07-21/13\" data-law-type=\"ARW\" data-article-number=\"4\">...</span> \n          ou du contrat se fait conformément à la procédure prévue \n          <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"3\" data-dossier-number=\"2016-07-21/13\" data-law-type=\"ARW\" data-article-number=\"4\">276/3.</span>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</article>",
